{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multiprofile multimodal model using pca_n2000 RNA encoding, resnet50 image encoding, and avgpool aggregation, comparing to the concat fusion baseline (config_018). Validation accuracy of 0.6390 and F1 of 0.6197 exceed the concat baseline (0.6186 accuracy, 0.6103 F1), suggesting weighted fusion may improve performance in this setup. However, the specific contribution of fusion strategy versus aggregation method interactions remains uncertain without direct comparison to other aggregation approaches."
}

